OL,5,G1000 The Beth Ditto Show
OL,6,     FBeth brightens up your Saturday
OL,7,     Fwith a healthy dose of tunes,
OL,8,     Flaughs and caffeine!
OL,9,G1300 Jamz Supernova
OL,10,     FJamz is joined by Norsicaa, the
OL,11,     FMalaysian-Australian DJ and
OL,12,     Fselector. She speaks on her
OL,13,     Flabel's focus on reissues and
OL,14,     Foverlooked music from the
OL,15,     FAsia-Pacific...
OL,16,G1500 Gilles Peterson
OL,17,     FGilles plays new music including
OL,18,     Ftracks from Ima, Thakzin and nomi.
OL,19,     FPlus, he invites soulful
OL,20,     Fsinger-songwriter Nao into the
OL,21,     Fstudio.
