OL,5,G1800 The Craig Charles Funk and Soul
OL,6,G     Show
OL,7,     FWe're off to Rio for this week's
OL,8,     FTrunk of Funk, with Ed Motta at
OL,9,     Fthe controls. Ed has spent more
OL,10,     Fthan 35 years moving between soul,
OL,11,     Fjazz, funk, bossa nova and boogie.
OL,12,G2100 Don Letts' Culture Clash Radio
OL,13,     FDon's Saturday night selections
OL,14,     Fcross time, space and genre. This
OL,15,     Fweek, he's got new numbers by
OL,16,     FGentleman's Dub Club, Yumi And The
OL,17,     FWeather, Inner Echo, Kaeto and
OL,18,     FIFULKI.
OL,19,G2300 SHERELLE
OL,20,     FKele Le Roc gets in the Cab to the
OL,21,     FClub and Eliza Rose selects a
OL,22,     Ftrack she wants to hear.
